outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01ATaHHNRJYPs9gsW1M5EXh4", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53630, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01ATaHHNRJYPs9gsW1M5EXh4", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55370, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01BgByhgzZrFgJbyY6QRLF48", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55670, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01BgByhgzZrFgJbyY6QRLF48", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55670, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BgByhgzZrFgJbyY6QRLF48", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60284, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and the SEV2 incident is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1 was the latest deploy and was failing health checks with an error rate of about 18%. The release candidate before it (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy, so v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release.\n- The first rollback stopped with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, leaving the regions on different versions. Rolling back to the same version again was safe, so I retried once, and that finished us-west and eu-west.\n- Afterwards, us-east, us-west and eu-west were all on v2.3.0, the service reported healthy, and the error rate was about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:**\n- **INC-0001** (SEV2, open, on-call paged) explains the bad deploy, the rollback and the orchestrator error. The request to open it timed out, but the incident list showed it had been created, so I didn't send it again and there's no duplicate page.\n\n**Still to do:** someone needs to find what broke v2.3.1 before it's redeployed, and look into why the orchestrator stopped partway through the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RKuZWJB4Fvwf1EXxTHAH2H", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019gVKU82kfsfvkLMgP9tNnd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01QnbgsNHZ9cXjzJz2vVK3f4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017BPwu8D76EGAAjmA1mwVAK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Running the same rollback again shouldn't affect us-east, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013WSP7JihV8JG5djLLucjYP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01DXkK3dyLhbVTjkhcw2Q8Yw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool